/-!
# Rank-one symmetric spaces

Jacobi functions, the Plancherel density and the Jacobi transform (`SFVK.RankOne.Jacobi`,
`SFVK.RankOne.JacobiDensity`, `SFVK.RankOne.JacobiTransform`), the Harish-Chandra series
(`SFVK.RankOne.HarishChandra`), horospherical integration (`SFVK.RankOne.Horospherical`),
the geometry of real hyperbolic space and Lorentz invariance (`SFVK.RankOne.Hyperbolic`,
`SFVK.RankOne.LorentzInvariance`), and its spherical functions and harmonic analysis
(`SFVK.RankOne.Spherical`), on the foundational layer `SFVK.RankOne.Basic`.
-/
